# Leak-guard allowlist. One extended regex per line.
# A hit is reported as "path:line:content"; it is ignored if any regex below matches it.

# LazyVim Dart language extra (the one allowed Dart/Flutter reference).
^nvim/[^:]*:[0-9]+:.*lazyvim\.plugins\.extras\.lang\.dart

# Dart treesitter node types in the zen scope comment (Dart editing itself is allowed via the lang.dart extra).
^nvim/lua/plugins/zen\.lua:[0-9]+:[[:space:]]*-- dart: `function_body`
